  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bosniskt filmst&#xF6;d via Gtg</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Bosnian film</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till bosnisk filmkultur. Projektet har tv&#xE5; syften, dels att visa den bosniska filmen Heroes som handlar om teaterarbetare i Sarajevo, p&#xE5; G&#xF6;teborgs Filmfestival, f&#xF6;r att underl&#xE4;tta spridandet av filmen ochatt bjuda in 2-3 personer f&#xF6;r att l&#xE5;ta dem praktisera p&#xE5; festivalen samt knyta internationella kontakter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Bosnian film culture. The project has two purposes: to enlarge the Bosnian film Heroes about theatre workers in Sarajevo during the war, in order to show it at the Gothenburg Film Festival 1999 and to facilitate its distribution and to train som technicians/ public relation staff in festival management.</narrative>
  </description>
